{
  "description": "Three page shapes cover the two built route families: the landing page (and five persona variants) and the 404. Out of scope by decision: pricing, download, awards, legal, blog, changelog, store and app-detail templates (listed in the repo-level IA, still being built). Add a template by appending an entry here, section contracts under sections/, the allowlist, graph and schema (see README 'Adding a template').",
  "scope": {
    "built": [
      "/",
      "/designers",
      "/product-managers",
      "/engineers",
      "/creators",
      "/teams",
      "/* (404)"
    ],
    "notModelled": "Every other route in the repo-level IA. Do not guess their structure from this repo."
  },
